      "fact_id": "5132577751d1fa8a585652276fc9e6b3c939e874bbc77518fd90507d518567b2",
      "fact_type": "OMBUDSMAN_SUMMARY",
      "predicate": "HAS_OMBUDSMAN_SUMMARY",
      "value": "There was fault by the Council. The Council delayed carrying out an annual review of an Education, Health and Care Plan. The Council also delayed making a decision on whether or not to make direct payments. This meant that two children received no educational provision from Section F of their Education, Health and Care Plan for one term and limited provision for two further terms. An apology, symbolic payment and review of procedures remedies the injustice to the family.",
